 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Publishing
+
+Anyone with a secret public URL can view a published board. Only board administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+Board JSON responses include a `public_url` attribute. It is `null` until the board is published.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board and generates a secret public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board payload. `public_url` is the secret URL for the published board.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. The previous public URL stops working.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `200 OK` with the board payload. `public_url` is `null`.
+
+## Public boards
+
+Published boards, their columns, and published cards can be opened without authentication via the secret key.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key`
+
+Returns the published board.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:id`
+
+Returns a column on the published board.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:number`
+
+Returns a published card on the published board. Draft cards are not available.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
+
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
 
 ### `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/accesses`
